        "Abstract": "This paper introduces MMLU-Pro, an enhanced dataset designed to extend the mostly knowledge-driven MMLU benchmark by integrating more challenging, reasoning-focused questions and expanding the choice set from four to ten options. MMLU-Pro eliminates trivial and noisy questions in MMLU. Experimental results show that MMLU-Pro not only raises the challenge but also demonstrates greater stability under varying prompts."
